+A deploy still logs no one out, since every server holds the same key. Rotating the key logs out every member at
+once, so the key is rotated only between pickups.
+
+`logout(member_id)` ([sessions](../features/sessions.md#logout)) ends a member's session on the server a volunteer
+calls it on, for a stolen phone or a similar emergency. Since no store is shared between the two servers behind the
+load balancer, a request the stolen phone makes to the other server is still accepted until the session's own
+30-minute expiry; a volunteer who needs both servers covered right away should rotate the key instead, logging out
+every member.
